  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> and <math><mi>D</mi></math> be four non-empty sets. The contrapositive statement of &ldquo;If <math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>D</mi></math> , then <math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> &rdquo; is"
  },
